🟢 4️⃣ Single Parameter – it Keyword

If only one parameter → you can use it

val square: (Int) -> Int = { it * it }

println(square(4))  // 16


Example 1

Return Type :- Compulsary

package com.androidtutorials.myapplication

fun main() {
    val square: (Int) -> Unit = { it * it }
    println(square(4))  // 16
}

Example 2

package com.androidtutorials.myapplication

fun main() {
    val square: (Int) -> Int = { it * it }
    println(square(4))  // 16
}


Example 3 :- CE

Explicit Fucntion should have a return type.

package com.androidtutorials.myapplication

fun main() {
    val square: (Int) ->  = { it * it }
    println(square(4))  // 16
}

