Passing Lambda as a Parameter.

🟢 5️⃣ Passing Lambda as Parameter (Very Important 🔥)

fun calculate(a: Int, b: Int, operation: (Int, Int) -> Int): Int {
    return operation(a, b)
}

Use it:

val result1 = calculate(5, 3) { x, y -> x + y }
val result2 = calculate(5, 3) { x, y -> x * y }

println(result1)  // 8
println(result2)  // 15

